# What enters the build context of `session-image/Dockerfile` (13/09).
#
# The context moved from `session-image/` to the repository root when payload compilation entered
# the Dockerfile: `tsc` needs the `.mts` files and their `package.json` from `runner-payload/`.
#
# BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile path>.dockerignore` before the root one, which belongs to
# `deploy/Dockerfile` and says something else. An older daemon falls back to the root file: the
# context grows, the build still works.
#
# Compiled `.mjs` files are excluded explicitly: no longer produced on disk, but an older clone still
# has some, and letting them in would let a COPY of stale files race the stage that just compiled
# them.
*
!runner-payload
!session-image
**/node_modules
session-image/*.mjs
